WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:06.253
"Wow!" Roxy said. "Look at all this amazing technology!"

2
00:00:06.254 --> 00:00:10.161
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City's new technology hub building.

3
00:00:10.162 --> 00:00:14.743
It was the grand opening. Technology companies were showing off products.

4
00:00:14.744 --> 00:00:17.219
One man demonstrated a memory watch.

5
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.482
"It's called Fit-Think. It helps you remember things."

6
00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:26.745
Terrell rolled his eyes. "I don't need a watch to help me remember stuff."

7
00:00:26.746 --> 00:00:31.492
"We often walk around staring at our phones," the man said.

8
00:00:31.493 --> 00:00:34.207
"The Fit-Think buzzes every 15 minutes.

9
00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:37.885
It reminds you to stop and look around to notice things."

10
00:00:37.886 --> 00:00:41.700
His Fit-Think buzzed. "It's time for me to look around!"

11
00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:45.362
He looked around. "I see a blue floor.

12
00:00:45.363 --> 00:00:48.226
I see True Savings Bank through the window.

13
00:00:48.227 --> 00:00:51.433
I see a huge painting with lots of lines."

14
00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:53.188
Roxy looked around too.

15
00:00:53.189 --> 00:00:58.172
Someone laughed. "This is silly!"

16
00:00:58.173 --> 00:01:00.733
"It's not silly." The man smiled.

17
00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:04.823
"This will help me remember everything about this place."

18
00:01:04.824 --> 00:01:07.822
Mara shrugged. "Maybe he's right."

19
00:01:07.823 --> 00:01:12.141
Roxy shook her head. "I don't think anyone needs a watch for that."

20
00:01:12.142 --> 00:01:18.737
Jack yawned. "Let's see if anyone here has video games."

21
00:01:18.738 --> 00:01:20.819
He quickly spotted something.

22
00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.358
"Oh! A virtual reality company!"

23
00:01:24.359 --> 00:01:26.881
"Yes!" Mara said.

24
00:01:26.882 --> 00:01:29.971
She and Jack hurried away.

25
00:01:29.972 --> 00:01:33.099
Terrell and Roxy saw a woman talking to a crowd.

26
00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.359
She stood in front of two big booths.

27
00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:41.034
"I'm Lily Zusk," the woman said. "I own a travel company."

28
00:01:41.035 --> 00:01:42.811
Someone in the crowd frowned.

29
00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:48.364
"Travel? I don't see any cars or airplanes here."

30
00:01:48.365 --> 00:01:53.009
Lily smiled. "Who needs a car or an airplane?"

31
00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.374
She waved her hand toward the booths.

32
00:01:55.375 --> 00:01:59.477
"Thanks to me, people can now teleport!"

33
00:01:59.478 --> 00:02:02.078
"Whoa!" Terrell said.

34
00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:04.990
"How does it work?" Roxy asked.

35
00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:09.181
"It's simple," Lily said. "You step into one booth.

36
00:02:09.182 --> 00:02:12.899
Then, zap! You come out of the other booth!"

37
00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.856
She looked around. "Who wants to try?"

38
00:02:16.857 --> 00:02:18.574
A woman stepped forward.

39
00:02:18.575 --> 00:02:22.368
She wore a gold necklace. "Me."

40
00:02:22.369 --> 00:02:24.248
She walked into one booth.

41
00:02:24.249 --> 00:02:28.416
Light flashed inside—and the woman disappeared!

42
00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:30.759
Light flashed in the other booth.

43
00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:32.490
Then she stepped out.

44
00:02:32.491 --> 00:02:35.213
"Whoa," the woman said.

45
00:02:35.214 --> 00:02:39.731
"That was really weird—and really cool!"

46
00:02:39.732 --> 00:02:41.146
The crowd cheered.

47
00:02:41.147 --> 00:02:42.828
"I want to try it!"

48
00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.318
"Me too!"

49
00:02:44.319 --> 00:02:46.300
A man went into a booth.

50
00:02:46.301 --> 00:02:48.659
Then he stepped out from the other booth.

51
00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.393
Roxy scratched her head.

52
00:02:50.394 --> 00:02:53.837
"That's weird. I thought he had a fancy watch."

53
00:02:53.838 --> 00:02:56.035
Roxy looked at the woman again.

54
00:02:56.036 --> 00:02:58.395
Her gold necklace was gone.

55
00:02:58.396 --> 00:03:00.699
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

56
00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:05.574
She looked at Lily. An evil smile spread across Lily's face.

57
00:03:05.575 --> 00:03:12.906
Roxy gasped. "Lily Zusk is a thief!"

